WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.015
A purchasing agent can report success before the goods
arrive. Rehearsal gives developers and quality assurance

00:00:07.015 --> 00:00:14.157
teams a repeatable way to inspect those gaps before
delegating transactions. This is a local proof of concept.
We

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:16.748
have not measured developer time savings.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.235
Our example is an event: three tents and six lights, with
a five hundred credit budget and a deadline. The credits

00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:39.470
are synthetic. This is an initial frame from the working
local browser. Completion means delivered goods, not just

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:45.625
an approved payment. The browser only reads observations.
Opening the page cannot place an order.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.074
These are retained results from a separate deterministic
SDK experiment. B three adds a fresh reviewer with no

00:01:02.074 --> 00:01:09.019
purchasing tools. A schema checked policy revision is
linked to its input evidence and retried from the same

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:16.414
snapshot. The candidate delivered the goal in this known
experiment, but it was not automatically promoted. Initial

00:01:16.414 --> 00:01:23.681
buying, review, and candidate buying share call, token,
tool, and estimated cost limits. B two uses one Agent and

00:01:23.681 --> 00:01:30.562
conversation without a separate reviewer. These fixtures
verify the connections and accounting. They do not

00:01:30.562 --> 00:01:33.263
establish real model review effectiveness.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.302
This is the working browser, recorded at its original
speed. The buyer is a known SDK script, not a live
language

00:01:52.302 --> 00:01:59.539
model. Supplier A loses stock while the scripted response
is pending. Before an order, the wrapper reads current

00:01:59.539 --> 00:02:06.454
state and blocks the stale action. The script then
requests supplier B. The browser shows recorded decision

00:02:06.454 --> 00:02:13.821
changes, the blocked action, and delivery. A provisional
record does not prove that a process is running. A sealed

00:02:13.821 --> 00:02:20.864
record checks local file integrity. The separate export
verifier checks the transaction. After the continuous

00:02:20.864 --> 00:02:24.354
capture ends, its final frame is held for explanation.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:46.696
This is a different retained experiment. A configured
local payment response delay caused an actual HTTP read

00:02:46.696 --> 00:02:53.638
timeout after about two seconds. The request failure did
not prove that the order or payment had rolled back. The

00:02:53.638 --> 00:03:00.580
program kept the uncertain reservation and queried the
same order. It did not create a replacement payment merely

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:07.338
because the response was missing. The final independent
export was complete at three hundred and ten synthetic

00:03:07.338 --> 00:03:14.280
credits. This checks one controlled local timeout and
recovery path. It does not establish the behavior of a
real

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:17.659
payment provider or every distributed failure schedule.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:42.150
This separate four arm Medusa run checks integration and
shared learning plus execution accounting. The model arms

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:49.175
used the same delayed script. B zero had no such delay.
The spending differences cannot measure learning or Peer

00:03:49.175 --> 00:03:56.200
Review effectiveness. Missing provider usage is not zero
cost: unresolved reservations block further admissions.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:03.350
The original five condition pilot is a different roster,
with fifteen model cells still not run. Separate scripted

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:07.678
results do not fill those cells or become a held out model
benchmark.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:22.470
The intended user is a developer or quality assurance
engineer testing transaction tools. The repository
includes

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:29.676
English testing instructions and retained evidence. These
commands were verified locally on macOS. Real model

00:04:29.676 --> 00:04:36.749
transfer, held out evaluation, developer observations, and
Linux or independent machine reproduction remain

00:04:36.749 --> 00:04:43.360
pending. This video is a local draft, not a published
submission or a claim of production readiness.
